{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792256340, "covers_from": "2026-10-17T16:59:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-17T17:00:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792256400, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-17T16:59:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 4727, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "環境", "content": "台北車站周邊一堆流浪漢，車站裡面一堆人坐在地上，很髒亂、很難看！讓我感覺身為台北人很可恥！", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.4,727", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-17T16:59:14+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 61428, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "環境", "content": "可以不要再砍樹了嗎？台北已經快要沒有遮蔭的地方了。", "display_name": "中正代表 Kate Chen", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-17T16:59:22+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 62344, "sprite_key": "beaver_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "公共安全", "content": "大陸疫情嚴重，請問衛福部及台北市等各大縣市是否已有在機場海關作好檢疫防控設施。", "display_name": "中正代表 frank陳", "mood": "positive", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-17T16:59:34+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 2355, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "觀光", "content": "中山站到雙連是很熱鬧的商圈 但很多小巷仍是人車爭道 希望可規劃徒步區 讓遊客更容易停留及聚集", "display_name": "中山代表 No.2,355", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-17T16:59:49+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 2551, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "台北市設置吸菸區地點是有經過思考的，而不是為了設置而設置", "display_name": "大安代表 No.2,551", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 61428, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "display_name": "中正代表 Kate Chen", "district": "zhongzheng", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 62344, "sprite_key": "beaver_oldtown", "display_name": "中正代表 frank陳", "district": "zhongzh